  "description": "Fast, light and powerful\nThe ELyte 150 RSX delivers the very best lightweight, natural mountain bike handling and ride feel together with the capability of full-fat electric mountain bikes (eMTBs). At just 18.9kg (size M) with 55Nm of torque, 600W of peak power, and 400Wh of battery, it packs the power to do it all: the climb, the singletrack, the all-day epic, the home trail hot laps, the drop-ins, the descents, the tech and the climbs back out.\n\nHighlights\n– 150mm front + 142mm rear of custom-tuned suspension travel.\n– Uni-directional carbon fibre frame is light and reassuringly strong.\n– Bosch Performance Line SX mid-torque (55Nm), full power (600W) motor.\n– 400Wh internal battery.\n– 29er wheels front and rear for balanced handling.\n\nPitch perfect parts\nThe ELyte 150 RSX is dressed in a curated parts list of trail-proven, real-world kit that will serve you brilliantly both now and for the long haul: SRAM GX T-Type AXS 1x12 wireless electronic gearing, Maxxis tyres, feedback-rich SRAM Code Bronze four-piston brakes, and more. Our own custom-tuned suspension from RockShox has also been meticulously tuned to deliver you outstanding, ground-hugging grip with the support you need to right from your first pedal stroke.\n\nELyte 150 RSX: fast, light and powerful.",
